{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Runic Obliteration grants its transform buff on Elemental Burst casts (#2734, partial fix)",
  "contract": [
    "Runic Obliteration 705560 Effect0 is SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL, ProcChance 20, trigger 805742",
    "(a bare SPELL_AURA_DUMMY buff). Spell.dbc ProcFlags is 0 and, before the fix, no spell_proc row",
    "existed, so casting Elemental Burst never granted 805742. After the fix (spell_proc row scoped to",
    "Elemental Burst 802202/family 38 mask2 0x20000, cast phase), repeated Elemental Burst casts must",
    "eventually apply aura 805742. This scenario proves ONLY the proc registration; it does not assert",
    "that a subsequent Primordial Blast cast is redirected into Runic Obliteration (805794), because no",
    "cast-redirect script exists yet -- that remains a separate, out-of-scope maintainer decision. 40",
    "trials at 20% bound the flake rate to 0.8^40 (about 0.013%) of seeing zero procs.",
    "Elemental Burst has a 2000 ms native cast time. Each trial waits 2500 ms for completion and",
    "asserts no cast failure; requests rejected as SPELL_IN_PROGRESS are not valid proc trials."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 150000,
